usage: bench_suite_numeric.py [-h] --output OUTPUT [--repetitions REPETITIONS]

Development benchmark: synchronized native primitives, independent outputs. No
model weights or Python code enter the production C library. Complete operands
and outputs accompany each timing; this is a baseline, not a speedup.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --output OUTPUT
  --repetitions REPETITIONS
